        "created_at": "2013-11-06T16:22:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>After repeated defeats by the Freedom Five Baron Blade snapped, he spent three years in a basement building Mountain Dew castles before he finally got a job as a Tech at a web-hosting company.</p><p>Now he spends his days complaining about the quality of coffee, turning every discussion into a political argument and occassionally resetting servers just to mess with unsuspecting websites.</p><p>Alerted to his nefarious actions the Freedom Five are offering two jelly donuts and an autographed picture for information leading to his capture.</p>",
