        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Foote wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Chrome. Why you would use any other browser is besides me.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nBecause the corporate overlords decree I must reside in IE-hell.  :confused: \n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Wow, I really was hoping you made it out of the Block during that prison riot.</p>\n<p>You should contact a lawyer if they let you do that. &nbsp;IE is cruel and unusual punishment, you gotta fight for your rights man, even F.I.L.T.E.R. isn't abov e the law. &nbsp;(unless they are, in which case I like F.I.L.T.E.R. and you are a whiner, Boo whiner, Yeah F.I.L.T.E.R.)</p>",
