        "created_at": "2013-11-06T18:47:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I hate to say I told you so…</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm pretty sure that's the logo of the website that's hosting the forums. It's just an error. It's happened before. Their logo has not changed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ah, who am I kidding? I LOVE to say I told you so!</p>",
