        "created_at": "2013-11-07T04:43:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>After repeated defeats by the Freedom Five Baron Blade snapped, he spent three years in a basement building Mountain Dew castles before he finally got a job as a Tech at a web-hosting company.Now he spends his days complaining about the quality of coffee, turning every discussion into a political argument and occassionally resetting servers just to mess with unsuspecting websites.Alerted to his nefarious actions the Freedom Five are offering two jelly donuts and an autographed picture for information leading to his capture.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Those jelly donuts must've really done the trick. The original logo is back and the Baron's plans have been foiled. All is well with the Multiverse…for now.</p>",
