        "created_at": "2013-11-08T01:43:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I tried Chrome once, realised I couldn't find a nice simple cookie management add-on like the one I can't live without in Firefox, and then quickly switched back.</p><p>And I'm still here with the 'fox, enjoying telling individual sites with a couple of clicks whether I want their tasty cookies or not rather than having the traditional three options of Yes, No, and Annoy Me By Asking Every Time Until I Switch Back To No And Get Frustrated That I Have To Switch Back To Yes Every Time I Want A Site To Actually Log Me In.</p>",
